**DIRAC
.TITLE
Water molecule. X2C Hamiltonian. CC energies.
.WAVE F
.PROPERTIES
**HAMILTONIAN
.X2C
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.SCF
.EXACC
*SCF
.EVCCNV
1.0E-9
**EXACC
.OCCUPIED
2..4
.VIRTUAL
5..9
.LAMBDA
.EXATENSOR
.TCONVERGENCE
1.0D-2
**PROPERTIES
.DIPOLE
.EFG
*END OF
